sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Web as Web App
    participant Auth as Auth API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Session as Session Store

    User->>Web: Submit email and password
    Web->>Auth: POST /login
    Auth->>DB: Find account by email
    DB-->>Auth: Account and password hash
    Auth->>Auth: Verify password hash
    alt Password valid
        Auth->>Session: Create session
        Session-->>Auth: Session ID
        Auth-->>Web: 200 OK + HttpOnly session cookie
        Web-->>User: Show dashboard
    else Password incorrect
        Auth-->>Web: 401 Unauthorized
        Web-->>User: Show invalid password error
    end
